# Copy this file to .env and fill in what you need. Every name below is
# declared in src/server/env.ts, which is the only place this application
# reads process.env; tests/server-env.test.ts fails when the two drift apart.

# Credential for the Anthropic adapter. Optional: left blank, the adapter still
# builds and reports ERR_LLM_AUTH on the request that needed a key, so `pnpm dev`
# answers rather than refusing to start.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Shared secret a caller of POST /api/ask must send as `Authorization: Bearer
# <value>`. Optional while nothing is billed, and required as soon as a provider
# credential above is set: src/server/env.ts refuses that combination, so a
# deployment that pays for answers cannot leave the endpoint open. It buys
# authentication only: this template ships no rate limit.
API_ACCESS_KEY=
